# UI / Design System

Direction: premium hardware lab + automotive configurator — **not** neon gamer kitsch.

## Palette

| Token | Hex |
|-------|-----|
| Background | `#070707` |
| Surface | `#101010` |
| Elevated | `#171717` |
| Text | `#F5F5F5` |
| Muted | `#8A8A8A` |
| Border | `#252525` |
| Accent | electric violet / cool blue — **sparingly** |

## Typography

- Display: Space Grotesk  
- Body: Geist / Inter  
- Technical: JetBrains Mono  

## Avoid

Excessive neon/gradients/glow, glassmorphism spam, huge glowing headlines, generic card grids, purple-on-white AI defaults.

## Layout notes

- Homepage = one continuous visual story; hero budget is tight.
- Builder desktop: left nav | center 3D | right summary. Mobile: step-by-step.
- Product cards: image, name, category, price, rating, key spec, stock + subtle hover.

Full: `docs/ui-design.md`.
